image_description = "Stylized fantasy card illustration, painterly digital art with clean bold shapes and soft cel-shaded lighting, whimsical and expressive young-adult tone like a modern indie RPG. Vertical 2:3 portrait composition for a full-art trading card. No text, no letters, no card frame, no border. Sunny gold and warm red palette. A huge, cheerful toad in a sweatband and a tiny weightlifting belt beaming on an iron leg-press throne in a torchlit cave, two iron plates glinting at his feet. Match NPC-QUADZILLA / CUT-QUADZILLA."
